    <string name="settings_diagnostico_scan_read_only">This scan is READ ONLY: it sends standard diagnostic requests to read data. It writes nothing, clears no codes, and modifies nothing on the vehicle — it\'s safe. Do it with the vehicle stopped.</string>
    <string name="settings_diagnostico_scan_steps">1. Scan a range with the vehicle on.\n2. Press Watch and change the drive mode: the identifier that changes value at that moment is the mode.\nYou can also discover modules and target the scan to one (e.g. look up a body control DID).</string>
    <string name="settings_diagnostico_discover_modules">Discover modules</string>
